<title>USA: BF Goodrich Q1 net shr $1.56 vs $0.37.</title>
<headline>BF Goodrich Q1 net shr $1.56 vs $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Ohio 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $1.56		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net		 85,000		   19,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  54,400		 53,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said its first quarter operating earnings per share were $0.47 versus $0.45 for the same quarter a year earlier. Analysts consensus for first quarter earnings per share was $0.46, according to First Call.</p>
<p>The company said that in the 1996 quarter, there was an earnings per share loss of $0.08.</p>
<p>The company said the sharply higher first quarter earnings for 1997 was primarily due to the sale of Tremco Inc to RPM Inc.</p>
</text>
